{
  // What each race's NPCs wear, by rank. Every list under a rank is one whole outfit; an NPC gets one of them at
  // random when it spawns, from the outfits whose items all exist (so an outfit from a mod that isn't installed is
  // skipped). If none is complete, it wears the plain vanilla rank outfit instead (see armorWithoutMods for the
  // Haradrim's own). An item code may end in "@slot" (such as "@face" or "@neck") to wear it in that gear slot.
  // Archers wear their recruits' outfits unless the race lists "archer". Riders wear their warriors'.
  // Races are the NPC type codes (test-<race>-<rank>): elf = the Wood Elves. After editing, run python tools/build.py.
  // The looks menu offers every helmet in a unit's outfits (and, for Men, Elves and Dwarves, the lower ranks' too).

